in juxtaposition.

**Relevance:**

- Provides an **archival/scholarly lead** suggesting both **Athens National 
Museum** and **Ashmolean Museum, Oxford** appear in the same context involving 
“The Ring of Nestor” and Mycenaean tree/pillar cult studies.  
- Useful as a starting point to search within the PDF (locally, outside this 
