iconographic parallels that he considered supportive of the Ring of Nestor’s 
authenticity.",
      "document_ref": "d4",
      "source_ref": "s4",
      "evidence_type": "other",
      "locator": null,
      "qualifiers": ["historiographical evidence of a pro‑authenticity 
